        "self": {
          "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/TransformerEngine/pulls/comments/4297983244"
        }
      },
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Compound sharding repeats an axis**\n\nWith `fsdp_resource=\"fsdp\"` and `tpsp_resource=\"tpsp\"`, a plain GEMM with input specs `((\"fsdp\", \"tpsp\"), None)` and `(None, (\"fsdp\", \"tpsp\"))` now keeps `\"tpsp\"` on the weight. The later activation gather compares whole tuples against individual axes, so it leaves `(\"fsdp\", \"tpsp\")` unchanged. The resulting output spec, `((\"fsdp\", \"tpsp\"), \"tpsp\")`, repeats an axis across dimensions and fails when building `NamedSharding`.\n\nPreviously, the whole weight spec was gathered and the output was valid. Remove overlapping axes from compound activation specs too, and add this case to the tests.",
      "commit_id": "59a8dbdbcc422a6206a3128a0ce4a0d2c3a6f16a",
      "created_at": "2026-10-16T18:27:14Z",
      "diff_hunk": "@@ -1003,17 +1003,16 @@ def _retain_axes(spec, keep):\n             lhs_cspecs = (None,) * len(lhs_cspecs)\n             rhs_cspecs = (None,) * len(rhs_cspecs)\n \n-            # Non-contracting dims of RHS always needs to be gathered along the FSDP axis\n+            # Non-contracting dims of RHS always needs to be gathered along the FSDP axis, and\n+            # along any FSDP-like axis (e.g. EP) that also shards a non-contracting dim of LHS.\n+            # Otherwise the LHS would be gathered below instead, which is far more traffic for\n+            # activations. TP/TPSP axes are excluded since sequence parallelism (incl. collective\n+            # GEMM) relies on gathering the LHS sequence dim instead of the weight.\n+            lhs_non_c_axes = {a for s in lhs_non_cspecs for a in _convert_axis_spec_to_list(s)}\n+            lhs_non_c_axes -= {gsr.tp_resource, gsr.tpsp_resource}\n+            rhs_gather_axes = lhs_non_c_axes | {gsr.fsdp_resource}\n             rhs_non_cspecs = tuple(\n-                (\n-                    None\n-                    if spec is not None\n-                    and (\n-                        spec == gsr.fsdp_resource\n-                        or (isinstance(spec, tuple) and gsr.fsdp_resource in spec)\n-                    )\n-                    else spec\n-                )\n+                _retain_axes(spec, set(_convert_axis_spec_to_list(spec)) - rhs_gather_axes)\n                 for spec in rhs_non_cspecs\n             )",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/NVIDIA/TransformerEngine/pull/3697#discussion_r4297983244",
